# Direct dependencies only — the packages MB itself imports or runs.
# The installable file is requirements.txt, GENERATED from this one so that every
# transitive dependency is pinned too (all boxes run byte-for-byte the same set,
# and the CVE gate audits exactly what production runs).
#
# To change a dependency: edit the pin HERE, then regenerate the lock:
#     venv/bin/pip install pip-tools
#     venv/bin/pip-compile --strip-extras requirements.in -o requirements.txt
# then run the test suite and ship the change as a normal PR.

